Subject: terminal: Herdr-backed terminals behind T3CODE_FABRIC_TERMINAL_RUNTIME=herdr (D61, D81)

Two hooks: the spawn candidates gain `herdr --session <name>`, and closing a terminal ends its
Herdr session. Not a PtyAdapter, because the adapter is not told which thread and terminal.

